-- THE WOODWARD IS THE WOOD (rome, 2026-10-23). His sprite was redrawn as a wood
-- creature in the office's coat; the words still called him a big man. They
-- match the picture now.
UPDATE mob_templates SET description = 'Something the wood has grown into the shape of a big man: bark for skin, split and furred with moss, a crown of broken twigs where the hair would be, and feet that are more root than foot. He wears what the office wore, a coat of oiled leather gone black with age, and carries a felling axe at the trail as though it weighs nothing, walking at a pace he has clearly walked a great many times. He is not searching for anything. He looks up when you come into view, and what is in the grain of his face is not surprise. It is the mild, unhurried interest of somebody who has found you on ground he is responsible for, and now has to decide what you are doing on it.'
 WHERE id = 'the-woodward';
